WEBVTT

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:47.030
Hey, those are mine!

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:49.400
Give me back my ruins!

00:01:53.933 --> 00:01:55.733
Please, hang in there.

00:01:56.233 --> 00:01:59.473
Why is Nene's Flying Fortress
taking the ruins?

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:01.730
Just to be mean, I bet!

00:02:03.733 --> 00:02:05.073
Catch up with them, quick!

00:02:05.533 --> 00:02:07.603
What'll happen if we do, maro?

00:02:07.766 --> 00:02:11.526
I haven't gotten my new power yet!

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:13.800
Nene's in there, maro.

00:02:14.833 --> 00:02:16.873
Nene?! Oh, no...

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:26.300
W-What should we do?

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:28.200
We have to fight.

00:02:28.466 --> 00:02:29.526
What?!

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:33.230
Have you forgotten that
we escaped on a wing and a prayer?

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:36.270
We're not who we were back then.

00:02:36.733 --> 00:02:41.773
We've gotten much stronger since then.
We've gotten more power.

00:02:42.566 --> 00:02:46.396
We can beat Nene now.
Yeah, we'll win this time for sure!

00:02:46.700 --> 00:02:47.370
- Right.
- Right.

00:02:48.733 --> 00:02:51.633
I still haven't gotten my power yet.

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:54.570
We will avoid battle with Nene
as much as we can.

00:02:55.133 --> 00:02:55.803
Zola!

00:02:56.266 --> 00:02:58.596
Bouquet has to get her power first.

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:00.870
What if Nene shows up to interfere?

00:03:01.266 --> 00:03:04.166
Then we'll have to fight
whether we like it or not.

00:03:04.733 --> 00:03:09.633
THE SHINING HIPPO

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:13.870
Powering off the flexible arms.

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:17.970
Stabilization of the target confirmed.
Lord Nene, the mooring was successful.

00:03:18.966 --> 00:03:20.796
Raising the altitude of
the Galleon to 10,000.

00:03:21.533 --> 00:03:22.973
What is our course?

00:03:23.733 --> 00:03:27.933
Let's see. Then let's head
for Korin at cruising speed.

00:03:28.066 --> 00:03:28.726
Roger.

00:03:29.466 --> 00:03:32.866
For Korin? A city populated
by master informants?

00:03:33.866 --> 00:03:40.396
It seems they have assembled
a force in Korin to resist us.

00:03:40.733 --> 00:03:42.503
A resistance movement?!

00:03:42.933 --> 00:03:45.573
It probably won't present
much of a threat,

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:52.330
but we might as well
since we have the chance.

00:03:52.566 --> 00:03:53.566
Where are you going?

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:56.400
To check out the Shadow ruins.

00:03:56.533 --> 00:03:58.403
Check out! Check out!

00:03:58.433 --> 00:03:59.773
I shall come along.

00:04:00.466 --> 00:04:03.226
You finish up your repairs already.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:05.230
Y-Yes, sir.

00:04:09.466 --> 00:04:12.126
Unidentified vessel.
State your affiliation and number.

00:04:12.666 --> 00:04:13.326
What is it?

00:04:13.833 --> 00:04:16.703
A small vessel is approaching,
but there's no response.

00:04:17.700 --> 00:04:19.300
State your affiliation and number.

00:04:19.666 --> 00:04:21.896
If you do not respond, you will be
considered an enemy and we will attack.

00:04:22.833 --> 00:04:24.073
What should we do?

00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:27.100
We have no way of responding.
Leave it.

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:28.870
They'll attack us.

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:30.470
Of course they will.

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:32.600
I'll defend against close range fire
with my Shadow.

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:54.930
So these are the Shadow ruins?

00:04:55.466 --> 00:04:58.796
At a glance, there really isn't
much to this place, huh?

00:04:58.933 --> 00:05:00.503
Not much, not much!

00:05:02.466 --> 00:05:03.466
What's going on?

00:05:09.666 --> 00:05:12.866
Oh, my.
What does Zola intend on doing?

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:15.530
Well, come if you can.

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:19.330
What's going on?!

00:05:19.366 --> 00:05:22.826
An unidentified vessel was approaching,
so we intercepted it, but...

00:05:23.633 --> 00:05:24.633
What's that?!

00:05:27.133 --> 00:05:28.403
Is that a Shadow?!

00:05:36.566 --> 00:05:37.226
Zola!

00:05:37.433 --> 00:05:39.673
We can't even get near!

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:41.970
We'll come up from beneath them!

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:42.970
Beneath them?

00:05:43.566 --> 00:05:45.226
The ruins created a blind spot.

00:05:45.566 --> 00:05:47.326
They can't fire at us if we're
directly underneath them!

00:05:47.633 --> 00:05:50.033
My ruins!

00:05:54.633 --> 00:05:58.373
I wonder if this is
Chapter Five of the Extra Seven.

00:06:04.700 --> 00:06:07.870
I can't figure out anything
even with it right in front of me.

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:09.800
Can't figure out! Can't figure out!

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:14.130
The Extra Seven is an old text
concerning the sealing of Shadows.

00:06:15.166 --> 00:06:19.796
But conversely, it can also explain
how to release a Shadow.

00:06:27.600 --> 00:06:30.000
We're shaking, maro.
We're shaking, maro.

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:33.000
Can't blame it.
We really pushed this thing to fly this far.

00:06:35.933 --> 00:06:37.333
This is it!

00:06:37.833 --> 00:06:38.833
Jump over!

00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:47.070
The unidentified vessel has gone down.

00:06:47.666 --> 00:06:50.096
Hey, but there's nobody on board.

00:06:50.533 --> 00:06:51.573
What's going on?

00:06:53.966 --> 00:06:54.996
Could it be?!

00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:01.700
Is everyone okay?

00:07:01.966 --> 00:07:02.966
Somehow.

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:05.430
That was totally a close one, maro.

00:07:06.133 --> 00:07:09.173
Thank goodness!
My ruins are just fine!

00:07:13.366 --> 00:07:14.026
Shu.

00:07:15.666 --> 00:07:17.066
Nene's up there.

00:07:18.066 --> 00:07:19.296
The ruins come first.

00:07:21.833 --> 00:07:22.903
Fine.

00:07:43.033 --> 00:07:44.133
Hey, look!

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:46.170
That's my Hippo!

00:07:46.366 --> 00:07:48.666
It does kinda look like him, maro.

00:07:48.966 --> 00:07:51.466
Kinda? No, it's definitely him!

00:07:58.066 --> 00:08:00.426
Chapter Five of the Extra Seven.

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:04.170
The sun soon sets.
It sets, but rises again.

00:08:05.100 --> 00:08:08.400
The seal of regeneration
is renewed every day.

00:08:09.033 --> 00:08:13.833
Those who lament their lack of power must
eliminate their Shadow in order to be reborn.

00:08:14.166 --> 00:08:14.826
Nene?!

00:08:15.133 --> 00:08:17.673
You know the Extra Seven?

00:08:17.833 --> 00:08:19.833
Which do you want to know?

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:25.970
How I know about it or what I'm
trying to do with the knowledge?

00:08:26.433 --> 00:08:29.433
More importantly,
what do you intend to do with my ruins?

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:32.630
Your ruins, huh?

00:08:33.933 --> 00:08:36.803
Th-That's right! My ruins!

00:08:48.333 --> 00:08:50.133
Bouquet's gone, maro!

00:08:50.233 --> 00:08:52.603
I bet she went inside the ruins!

00:08:53.366 --> 00:08:56.366
I see. So, that's how it is...

00:08:57.033 --> 00:09:01.003
I had thought about solving
the riddle of these ruins if I could.

00:09:01.866 --> 00:09:06.596
But as I expected, the ruins only respond
to the Wielder of their Shadow.

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:09.270
Someone like you can't figure out!

00:09:09.666 --> 00:09:13.166
Then maybe I should just destroy them.

00:09:13.533 --> 00:09:15.003
What?!

00:09:15.033 --> 00:09:16.873
Stop it!

00:09:18.100 --> 00:09:20.670
I mean, where am I?

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:25.630
I get it. I bet I was pulled inside
the ruins like Shu and Kluke.

00:09:26.166 --> 00:09:29.626
The wall is transparent and
I can see through to the other side...

00:09:31.633 --> 00:09:32.803
It's a statue of Hippo...

00:09:33.166 --> 00:09:36.596
I know you guys have been
solving the riddles of the ruins

00:09:36.633 --> 00:09:38.233
and making your Shadows stronger.

00:09:38.700 --> 00:09:41.230
I was interested in how you do it,

00:09:41.266 --> 00:09:43.626
but it seems they just correspond
with each Shadow Wielder

00:09:43.666 --> 00:09:45.366
and it won't work for anybody else.

00:09:45.666 --> 00:09:49.396
Yeah, there's nothing that
will help in your research.

00:09:49.800 --> 00:09:52.800
You won't get any stronger.

00:09:53.166 --> 00:09:55.426
You've got some nerve, Zola.

00:09:55.933 --> 00:09:58.603
But your journey of unlocking
the powers ends here.

00:09:58.833 --> 00:10:02.533
And that little girl will be finished as well
without unlocking her power.

00:10:03.866 --> 00:10:04.526
What?

00:10:04.966 --> 00:10:05.626
Nene!

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:08.570
I've gotten my power!

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:09.700
Mine, too!

00:10:09.733 --> 00:10:10.733
And mine, maro!

00:10:10.766 --> 00:10:11.766
I have, too!

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:15.100
It's gonna be different this time!

00:10:18.400 --> 00:10:20.570
You kids just never learn.

00:10:20.833 --> 00:10:24.633
Have you forgotten that you were
absolutely no match for me?

00:10:24.700 --> 00:10:25.930
No, we haven't!

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:28.870
That's why we got stronger, maro!

00:10:31.633 --> 00:10:33.203
Blue Dragon!

00:10:36.866 --> 00:10:38.266
Minotaur!

00:10:44.833 --> 00:10:46.833
Saber Tiger!

00:10:48.800 --> 00:10:49.800
Phoenix!

00:10:56.633 --> 00:10:58.503
This time, you're going down.

00:10:58.633 --> 00:11:00.603
We don't just accept our defeat quietly.

00:11:00.766 --> 00:11:02.966
It's going to be different this time!

00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:05.270
This time I'm here, too.

00:11:05.966 --> 00:11:07.196
Fine.

00:11:07.366 --> 00:11:09.726
Come and get me when you're ready.

00:11:13.966 --> 00:11:15.726
Go!

00:11:30.266 --> 00:11:30.926
How about that?!

00:11:32.766 --> 00:11:38.726
You've got some nerve.
Then I guess I'll get serious.

00:11:38.766 --> 00:11:40.266
Serious, serious!

00:11:41.566 --> 00:11:45.726
Show me your enhanced powers!

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:53.500
What's happening here?

00:11:54.300 --> 00:11:55.300
Boss Lady, Boss Lady.

00:11:55.800 --> 00:11:56.800
Hippo!

00:11:57.033 --> 00:12:01.003
We have to solve the riddle
and increase our power quickly.

00:12:01.433 --> 00:12:02.703
Everyone's waiting.

00:12:02.833 --> 00:12:04.133
Oh, yeah.

00:12:04.533 --> 00:12:07.733
You're right.
Chapter Five of the Extra Seven...

00:12:08.333 --> 00:12:09.473
The sun soon...

00:12:10.433 --> 00:12:11.433
What was it again?

00:12:11.800 --> 00:12:13.630
I don't remember.

00:12:13.833 --> 00:12:15.173
We have to read it again.

00:12:15.833 --> 00:12:21.833
Hipopon, Hipotama, Transform.
Turn into Chapter Five of the Extra Seven!

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:25.530
What? Huh?

00:12:26.233 --> 00:12:28.473
I can't read it myself!

00:12:28.733 --> 00:12:31.333
That's a really good point.

00:12:36.300 --> 00:12:38.970
Now, bring it on.

00:12:39.366 --> 00:12:40.726
Go!

00:12:46.966 --> 00:12:49.166
You little!

00:12:49.266 --> 00:12:50.426
Now, maro!

00:12:54.133 --> 00:12:55.133
How about that?!

00:12:58.400 --> 00:13:04.900
It seems you can back up your words.
But how about this? Graviton Ball!

00:13:06.366 --> 00:13:07.366
Phoenix!

00:13:08.266 --> 00:13:09.966
Feather Protect!

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:19.970
You again? Fine. You'll be first today!

00:13:21.833 --> 00:13:23.633
Knock it off!

00:13:26.300 --> 00:13:28.170
You'd better pay attention!

00:13:28.766 --> 00:13:31.266
I'm going to knock you flat!

00:13:32.466 --> 00:13:33.526
You!

00:13:35.366 --> 00:13:36.396
Waves of Rage!

00:13:50.900 --> 00:13:53.630
Don't get carried away, you brats!

00:13:54.133 --> 00:13:59.433
It seems you've gotten stronger than before,
but you're still no match for me!

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:00.600
True...

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:05.100
No one would probably be able to
defeat you one-on-one.

00:14:05.866 --> 00:14:09.766
But, in this situation,
I'd say we're just about equal.

00:14:11.366 --> 00:14:16.066
I will be joining in too. Now, who's better?

00:14:16.233 --> 00:14:17.333
What did you say?

00:14:17.400 --> 00:14:18.400
What's the matter?

00:14:18.666 --> 00:14:20.766
You got so used to
sitting on the throne

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:23.800
that you're no longer able to think,
Professor Nene?

00:14:23.833 --> 00:14:24.833
Zola!

00:14:24.866 --> 00:14:29.326
You were just a researcher
who ascended to the throne

00:14:29.366 --> 00:14:31.496
by studying the power
of the Shadow.

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:34.370
You should've been satisfied with that.

00:14:36.266 --> 00:14:39.366
That's enough of your smart talk, Zola!

00:14:49.766 --> 00:14:50.426
Zola...

00:14:50.966 --> 00:14:51.966
You?!

00:14:56.633 --> 00:14:59.303
Don't tell me...
you've already unlocked your power?

00:14:59.766 --> 00:15:00.826
Lord Nene!

00:15:01.633 --> 00:15:03.703
I knew it was them.

00:15:03.733 --> 00:15:05.133
I leave the rest to you.

00:15:07.033 --> 00:15:09.303
Damn it! You again, Szabo?!

00:15:09.600 --> 00:15:11.970
Hold it, Nene! You won't get away!

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:18.770
My position is too important to be
dealing with garbage like you guys.

00:15:19.066 --> 00:15:20.726
Moron! You just did, maro!

00:15:20.766 --> 00:15:22.326
You're just crying sour grapes.

00:15:22.533 --> 00:15:26.603
I'm busy. We will soon be over
the skies above Korin.

00:15:27.033 --> 00:15:29.373
Korin? The town of master informants?

00:15:30.033 --> 00:15:31.303
That's where Homeron was from!

00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:37.470
It seems there are people gathering up
in Korin who think that they can defy me.

00:15:37.666 --> 00:15:39.926
They're probably stragglers
from Jibral or something.

00:15:40.666 --> 00:15:41.796
Conrad and the others?!

00:15:42.366 --> 00:15:46.096
I'm going to drop these
ruins onto their heads.

00:15:47.233 --> 00:15:48.233
Nene!

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:50.800
Get them!

00:15:52.633 --> 00:15:54.103
Out of my way!

00:15:54.266 --> 00:15:56.166
Shu, hang in there!

00:15:56.500 --> 00:15:57.770
But, what are we going to do?

00:15:58.400 --> 00:16:00.830
We just have to solve
the riddle of these ruins.

00:16:01.533 --> 00:16:03.873
But we can't remember the text!

00:16:03.966 --> 00:16:06.866
Zola! Tell us what Chapter Five says!

00:16:18.233 --> 00:16:19.233
Here they come.

00:16:21.166 --> 00:16:23.026
Are you running away, Szabo?!

00:16:23.566 --> 00:16:27.396
You fool. I was trying to
lure you guys outside.

00:16:27.833 --> 00:16:28.833
Get them.

00:16:29.400 --> 00:16:30.400
Maro!

00:16:31.533 --> 00:16:33.073
Reinforcements from the Galleon?!

00:16:34.833 --> 00:16:36.703
I wonder how Bouquet's doing.

00:16:37.033 --> 00:16:38.473
Which will happen first?

00:16:39.466 --> 00:16:44.826
Nene dropping these ruins
or Bouquet coming back out?

00:16:45.133 --> 00:16:47.233
Umm, what if she doesn't come out?

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:50.600
We might lose her then.

00:16:50.633 --> 00:16:51.303
What?

00:16:51.366 --> 00:16:52.696
Why?!

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:55.670
Inside of these ruins,
space is not ordinary.

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:59.700
I'm not sure if she'll be able to come out
even if the ruins are smashed up.

00:16:59.800 --> 00:17:01.300
That's true, but...

00:17:01.666 --> 00:17:03.366
We'll wait until the last moment.

00:17:04.166 --> 00:17:08.826
But we'll have to escape
if Nene drops these ruins.

00:17:09.100 --> 00:17:10.100
Korin?

00:17:10.333 --> 00:17:12.003
We will arrive in
approximately five minutes.

00:17:12.733 --> 00:17:14.173
Calculating drop point.

00:17:15.666 --> 00:17:20.696
Knight Masters from all over the world will
gather soon and we will launch a rebellion.

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:26.900
Regarding the surrounding areas currently
occupied by the Grankingdom Army, we...

00:17:29.666 --> 00:17:31.566
I have received information that

00:17:31.800 --> 00:17:33.930
Nene's Flying Fortress Galleon
is headed for Korin!

00:17:34.766 --> 00:17:35.426
What?!

00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:42.500
Three minutes until the drop point.

00:17:43.033 --> 00:17:45.703
Zola, stamp your feet in vexation.

00:17:46.100 --> 00:17:47.570
Zola!

00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:50.830
W-What?!

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:56.500
Boss Lady, isn't that thing that looks like
the sun the key to us powering up?

00:17:56.766 --> 00:17:58.396
Yeah, maybe.

00:17:58.966 --> 00:18:00.366
I'll give it a touch!

00:18:05.200 --> 00:18:06.200
Boss Lady!

00:18:06.666 --> 00:18:10.426
I get knocked back by incredible power
when I approach it...

00:18:11.433 --> 00:18:15.803
It seems that's the key, for sure.
Then, I'll try!

00:18:20.166 --> 00:18:21.896
It won't work, Boss Lady!

00:18:22.300 --> 00:18:26.030
As you know,
I'm no good with feats of strength.

00:18:26.533 --> 00:18:27.573
Then let's try together!

00:18:27.700 --> 00:18:28.700
Right!

00:18:35.533 --> 00:18:37.273
Yeah, it's not working!

00:18:37.466 --> 00:18:42.266
Hang in there, Hippo!
We'll always be in everyone's way as is!

00:18:47.566 --> 00:18:48.826
You!

00:18:51.366 --> 00:18:53.426
Blue Explosion!

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:02.500
The second engine room has been hit!

00:19:02.900 --> 00:19:04.730
Drop the ruins!

00:19:04.966 --> 00:19:06.726
Releasing the object! Dropping!

00:19:09.100 --> 00:19:10.170
How about that?!

00:19:13.900 --> 00:19:15.200
What happened, maro?!

00:19:15.600 --> 00:19:17.330
Nene discarded the ruins!

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:24.270
Exactly! And now this mass of rock
will fall on Korin like a bomb.

00:19:24.833 --> 00:19:27.473
No way?!
What about Conrad and the others?!

00:19:32.800 --> 00:19:34.470
Hurry and evacuate the residents!

00:19:40.333 --> 00:19:41.433
What're they trying to do?!

00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:45.570
We're going to fall on Korin!

00:19:46.133 --> 00:19:47.133
No!

00:19:47.166 --> 00:19:50.226
The only thing we can do to prevent
damage is to destroy these ruins!

00:19:50.566 --> 00:19:52.566
What'll happen to Bouquet, maro?

00:19:57.533 --> 00:20:00.303
It's incredible power, Boss Lady.

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:07.570
I... I just don't have enough strength...
I'm sorry.

00:20:08.066 --> 00:20:08.726
Hippo.

00:20:09.833 --> 00:20:11.003
That's not true!

00:20:12.133 --> 00:20:12.803
Boss Lady.

00:20:13.233 --> 00:20:17.503
Even without the power to fight,
we should have other strengths.

00:20:17.766 --> 00:20:20.396
You're a Shadow and
I'm a Shadow Wielder.

00:20:20.866 --> 00:20:23.626
We can't just be getting in
everyone's way.

00:20:24.466 --> 00:20:25.466
Boss Lady...

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:28.670
Please, Hippo!
Let's make this work somehow!

00:20:30.033 --> 00:20:31.033
Boss Lady...

00:20:31.300 --> 00:20:31.970
Alright!

00:20:32.566 --> 00:20:37.966
Follow behind me!
I'll shield you from that incredible light!

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:39.000
Hippo...

00:20:44.433 --> 00:20:46.333
Hang in there, Hippo!

00:20:46.666 --> 00:20:49.126
Those who lament
their lack of power

00:20:49.166 --> 00:20:51.896
must eliminate their Shadow
in order to be reborn.

00:20:56.800 --> 00:20:57.830
Hippo!

00:20:57.866 --> 00:21:00.096
Boss Lady! Now!

00:21:00.133 --> 00:21:03.503
We can do it!

00:21:18.833 --> 00:21:19.503
Bouquet!

00:21:20.033 --> 00:21:21.033
Let's get out of here!

00:21:27.833 --> 00:21:28.503
That's!

00:21:28.966 --> 00:21:31.466
Blue Explosion!

00:21:35.833 --> 00:21:36.833
We did it!

00:21:38.366 --> 00:21:40.026
Are those...Shadows?!

00:21:52.066 --> 00:21:53.196
Shu and the others, huh?

00:21:56.166 --> 00:21:58.296
That was totally a close shave, maro.

00:21:58.400 --> 00:21:59.670
We let Nene get away.

00:22:00.566 --> 00:22:02.966
We can definitely defeat him
the next time we fight.

00:22:03.466 --> 00:22:06.266
I've gotten my power too,
so we're even stronger.

00:22:07.300 --> 00:22:10.470
Now five of us have completed
getting our new power.

00:22:10.866 --> 00:22:11.526
Hey, Zola...

00:22:12.333 --> 00:22:14.473
There are seven
Soldiers of Light, right?

00:22:15.100 --> 00:22:16.530
But there are six of us.

00:22:16.700 --> 00:22:18.370
Don't we need to find the last one?

00:22:19.566 --> 00:22:24.626
We will be going to meet
the last Soldier of Light soon.

00:22:33.833 --> 00:22:34.833
Lord Nene!

00:22:35.300 --> 00:22:36.830
Summon Logi.

00:22:37.400 --> 00:22:38.070
What?

00:22:39.800 --> 00:22:41.430
Summon General Logi!

00:24:17.833 --> 00:24:21.373
Bouquet arises to save the group
from struggling with Szabo's traps.

00:24:21.566 --> 00:24:23.696
Hippo, let's turn them into stones.

00:24:23.733 --> 00:24:25.173
Can we do that?

00:24:25.200 --> 00:24:27.530
What? Then what can you do now?

00:24:27.566 --> 00:24:28.226
I have no clue.

00:24:28.266 --> 00:24:31.526
Well, then I guess I'll have to use
my awesome body to enchant them...

00:24:31.566 --> 00:24:33.566
Boss lady, they're machines.

00:24:33.600 --> 00:24:36.130
Next on Blue Dragon:
Whisper Whisper Boom!
